    <h2>Experience is operational memory.</h2>
    <p>Freight forwarding is shaped by countless decisions that rarely appear on a quotation: whether the cargo is ready, whether the documentation matches, how equipment will reach the loading point, and who handles the unexpected when a schedule changes. We believe those decisions deserve the same attention as the freight rate itself.</p>

    <h2 id="where-we-operate">Where we operate</h2>
    <p>Yentrans is headquartered in Kochi, India, and operates across an Indian logistics network with regional activity in the UAE and Oman. Our teams coordinate freight bookings, documentation, customs-related processes and inland movement in markets where we have the appropriate operational arrangements. International destination movements are supported through shipping lines and logistics partners.</p>

    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li><strong>Practical before promotional.</strong> We explain the workable options rather than promise a result we cannot control.</li>
      <li><strong>Documentation is part of operations.</strong> Accuracy matters at every handover, not just at final clearance.</li>
      <li><strong>Cargo comes first.</strong> Equipment, transit time and handling are selected with the product's requirements in mind.</li>
      <li><strong>People take ownership.</strong> A shipment needs a responsible team, not a sequence of unanswered emails.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we're building next</h2>
    <p>As global trade changes, Yentrans continues to strengthen its operating systems, develop its people, and broaden the industries and markets it can serve. We intend to combine the values of an experienced logistics business with clearer processes, better communication and new capabilities.</p>

